          "speaker": "漂泊者_选项",
          "speakers": {
            "zh-Hans": "漂泊者_选项"
          },
          "speakerId": null,
          "textKey": "Main_HuangLong_SYYLFML_20_3",
          "text": "（写下拉贝尔学部废除危机的事）",
          "texts": {
            "zh-Hans": "（写下拉贝尔学部废除危机的事）"
          },
          "textSource": "manual-override",
          "options": [],
          "jumpToId": null,
          "playVoice": false,
          "sourcePath": "search_v2:126:157756",
          "manualOverrideLine": {
            "origin": "search-api",
            "manualInserted": true,
            "sourcePath": "search_v2:126:157756",
            "flowKey": "剧情_3_5_拉海洛今州_4_1",
            "flowKeys": [
              "剧情_3_5_拉海洛今州_4_1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "speaker": "{PlayerName}",
          "speakers": {
            "zh-Hans": "{PlayerName}"
          },
          "speakerId": null,
          "textKey": "Main_HuangLong_SYYLFML_20_7",
          "text": "虚无鸣式阿列夫一……那是能吞噬人的意志，否定人存在意义的可怖存在……多亏了隧者「拉海洛」，星炬学院的大家，还有当地的罗伊人们，我们才得以击败它。",
          "texts": {
            "zh-Hans": "虚无鸣式阿列夫一……那是能吞噬人的意志，否定人存在意义的可怖存在……多亏了隧者「拉海洛」，星炬学院的大家，还有当地的罗伊人们，我们才得以击败它。"
          },
          "textSource": "manual-override",
          "options": [],
          "jumpToId": null,
          "playVoice": false,
          "sourcePath": "search_v2:126:157757",
          "manualOverrideLine": {
            "origin": "search-api",
            "manualInserted": true,
            "sourcePath": "search_v2:126:157757",
            "flowKey": "剧情_3_5_拉海洛今州_4_1",
            "flowKeys": [
              "剧情_3_5_拉海洛今州_4_1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "speaker": "{PlayerName}",
          "speakers": {
            "zh-Hans": "{PlayerName}"
          },
          "speakerId": null,
          "textKey": "Main_HuangLong_SYYLFML_20_9",
          "text": "那之后……拉海洛，想必能诞生出一支崭新的，璀璨耀眼的「文明」吧。",
          "texts": {
            "zh-Hans": "那之后……拉海洛，想必能诞生出一支崭新的，璀璨耀眼的「文明」吧。"
          },
          "textSource": "manual-override",
          "options": [],
          "jumpToId": null,
          "playVoice": false,
          "sourcePath": "search_v2:126:157758",
          "manualOverrideLine": {
            "origin": "search-api",
            "manualInserted": true,
            "sourcePath": "search_v2:126:157758",
            "flowKey": "剧情_3_5_拉海洛今州_4_1",
            "flowKeys": [
              "剧情_3_5_拉海洛今州_4_1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "speaker": "{PlayerName}",
          "speakers": {
            "zh-Hans": "{PlayerName}"
          },
          "speakerId": null,
          "textKey": "Main_HuangLong_SYYLFML_20_10",
          "text": "隧者消失后，深空联合的投资方一度想要关闭拉贝尔学部……但在洛瑟菈校长的据理力争，和学院大家的实际行动下，拉贝尔学部得以保留。",
          "texts": {
            "zh-Hans": "隧者消失后，深空联合的投资方一度想要关闭拉贝尔学部……但在洛瑟菈校长的据理力争，和学院大家的实际行动下，拉贝尔学部得以保留。"
          },
          "textSource": "manual-override",
          "options": [],
          "jumpToId": null,
          "playVoice": false,
          "sourcePath": "search_v2:126:157759",
          "manualOverrideLine": {
            "origin": "search-api",
            "manualInserted": true,
            "sourcePath": "search_v2:126:157759",
            "flowKey": "剧情_3_5_拉海洛今州_4_1",
            "flowKeys": [
              "剧情_3_5_拉海洛今州_4_1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "speaker": "{PlayerName}",
          "speakers": {
            "zh-Hans": "{PlayerName}"
          },
          "speakerId": null,
          "textKey": "Main_HuangLong_SYYLFML_20_12",
          "text": "未来，他们仍会朝着天空努力前进。",
          "texts": {
            "zh-Hans": "未来，他们仍会朝着天空努力前进。"
          },
